WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:02.710
- Welcome back to Bucket-O-Pups,

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:05.250
the only game show where
you get to fill a bucket

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.367
full of puppies.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.250
We have three contestants here today.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.001
Sara, say hello to the audience.

00:00:10.001 --> 00:00:10.667
- Howdy.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:11.251
- Briana.

00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:11.911
- Hello.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:12.784
- And Curly.

00:00:12.784 --> 00:00:13.542
- Hey, guys.

00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:17.075
- You have 30 seconds
to put as many puppies

00:00:17.075 --> 00:00:19.459
in this bucket as possible.

00:00:19.459 --> 00:00:21.960
If the puppies escape, feel
free to put them back in.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.294
Only one puppy at a time.

00:00:24.294 --> 00:00:27.184
No double fisting with puppies.

00:00:27.184 --> 00:00:28.074
Curly's first.

00:00:28.074 --> 00:00:29.746
30 seconds.

00:00:29.746 --> 00:00:31.125
Let it go.

00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:35.085
(whimsical music)

00:00:39.991 --> 00:00:42.065
Oh, we have an escapee.

00:00:42.991 --> 00:00:44.002
Five,

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:48.792
- [All] four, three, two, one.

00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:51.742
(clanging)

00:00:51.742 --> 00:00:53.959
- Three puppies in the bucket.

00:00:53.959 --> 00:00:55.709
How'd you feel about Curly's performance?

00:00:55.709 --> 00:00:56.878
- I thought he did well.

00:00:56.878 --> 00:00:58.243
- Yeah, you think you can beat three?

00:00:58.243 --> 00:00:59.626
- That bitch has nothing on me.

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.459
- Is everybody getting ready?

00:01:01.459 --> 00:01:03.703
And unleash the hounds.

00:01:03.703 --> 00:01:07.908
(dramatic music)

00:01:11.451 --> 00:01:12.876
That's one in the bucket.

00:01:12.876 --> 00:01:13.864
One in the bucket.

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:17.547
Oh, look at this, two in the bucket.

00:01:17.547 --> 00:01:19.784
Three, Briana, here we go.

00:01:19.784 --> 00:01:22.210
Oh, four in the bucket.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:23.710
Down to three.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:24.991
And four.

00:01:24.991 --> 00:01:27.327
Five, four,

00:01:27.327 --> 00:01:31.172
three, two, one.

00:01:31.172 --> 00:01:32.702
(clanging)

00:01:32.702 --> 00:01:35.084
Four puppies for Briana in the bucket.

00:01:35.084 --> 00:01:36.709
Four puppies, how do you feel about that?

00:01:36.709 --> 00:01:37.669
- I can do five.

00:01:37.669 --> 00:01:39.376
- Five puppies, all right.

00:01:39.376 --> 00:01:42.035
Get the timer set, go.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:43.459
One puppy in the bucket.

00:01:43.459 --> 00:01:44.584
Two puppies.

00:01:44.584 --> 00:01:46.742
Three puppies in the bucket.

00:01:46.742 --> 00:01:49.074
Four puppies in the bucket.

00:01:49.074 --> 00:01:51.376
Five, four, three.

00:01:51.376 --> 00:01:53.251
Four puppies in the bucket.

00:01:53.251 --> 00:01:55.918
Five, oh, down to three.

00:01:55.918 --> 00:01:56.835
Four.

00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:01.499
Three, two, one.

00:02:01.499 --> 00:02:02.459
(clanging)

00:02:02.459 --> 00:02:04.910
Five puppies in the bucket.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:07.125
And today's winner in Bucket-O-Pups,

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:10.125
Sara, congratulations,
five puppies in the bucket.

00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:12.062
(exciting music)

00:02:12.062 --> 00:02:14.084
[All] Bucket-O-Pups!

